## 1. PURPOSE

This document is the **only authoritative specification** for the INDAI Clean project.

Any file, code, documentation, architectural decision, automation, or content  
that contradicts this document **must be changed** to comply with it.

There are no exceptions.

This document:
- overrides any code implementation;
- overrides any child canon document;
- overrides SKILL.md where they conflict;
- defines what constitutes a correct implementation of this project.

