## 6. CANONICAL `/src` STRUCTURE

```
src/
├── app/
│   ├── layout.tsx                # Root layout (SEO, fonts, global providers)
│   ├── page.tsx                  # Homepage
│   ├── not-found.tsx             # Custom 404
│   ├── error.tsx                 # Global error boundary
│   ├── globals.css               # Tailwind base + custom properties
│   ├── (routes)/                 # Grouped route segments
│   │   └── services/
│   │       └── [slug]/
│   │           └── page.tsx
│   └── api/
│       ├── leads/route.ts        # Form submissions
│       ├── quiz/route.ts         # Quiz calculator
│       └── upload/route.ts       # S3 file upload
│
├── components/
│   ├── layout/                   # Header, Footer, Navigation
│   ├── sections/                 # Page sections (HeroSection, ServicesSection, etc.)
│   └── ui/                       # Atomic UI: Button, Card, Input, Badge
│
├── lib/
│   ├── prisma.ts                 # Prisma client singleton — sole import point
│   ├── s3.ts                     # File upload utilities
│   ├── utils.ts                  # Helpers (cn(), formatPrice, etc.)
│   └── constants.ts              # App-wide constants
│
