    └── index.ts                  # Shared TypeScript types & interfaces
```

### Rules

- **No new top-level directories** inside `src/` without addendum to this spec
- Components with `useState`/`useEffect` **must** have `'use client'` directive
- Server Components are the default — only add `'use client'` when required
- Prisma client: import only from `@/lib/prisma`, never instantiate directly
- All component files: PascalCase (`HeroSection.tsx`)
- All utility files: camelCase (`formatPrice.ts`)
- All route handlers: `route.ts` inside descriptive folder (`api/leads/route.ts`)
- No business text or service copy inside components — all sourced from content MD

