## 11. API GOVERNANCE

### 11.1 Canonical routes

| Route | Method | Purpose | Auth |
|-------|--------|---------|------|
| `/api/leads` | POST | Form submissions (F1–F6) | Public |
| `/api/quiz` | POST | Quiz calculator | Public |
| `/api/upload` | POST | S3 file upload | Public (rate-limited) |

New API routes require addendum to this document.

### 11.2 Request validation

- Every API route **must** validate input with Zod schema
- Invalid input returns `400` with structured error

### 11.3 Response format (mandatory)

Success:
```json
{
  "success": true,
  "data": { ... }
}
```

Error:
```json
{
  "success": false,
  "error": {
    "code": "VALIDATION_ERROR",
    "message": "Human-readable message"
  }
}
```

### 11.4 Rate limiting

- `/api/upload`: max 10 requests per IP per minute
- `/api/leads`, `/api/quiz`: max 30 requests per IP per minute

### 11.5 Security rules for API

- No PII in URL query parameters
- All user input sanitized before database write
- File uploads: whitelist extensions (jpg, jpeg, png, webp, pdf), max 10MB

