## 14. SEO REQUIREMENTS

### 14.1 Per-page requirements

Every page **must** have:
- `<title>` — unique, max 60 characters
- `<meta name="description">` — unique, max 160 characters
- `<link rel="canonical">` — absolute URL
- Open Graph tags: `og:title`, `og:description`, `og:image` (1200×630), `og:url`
- `og:locale` = `ru_RU`
- `og:type` = `website` (homepage) or `article` (service pages)

### 14.2 Site-wide requirements

- `/robots.txt` — allow all, reference sitemap
- `/sitemap.xml` — auto-generated, includes all published service pages
- Structured data (JSON-LD): `Organization`, `LocalBusiness`, `Service` schemas
- All images have `alt` text in Russian
- No orphan pages (every page reachable from navigation)

