## 22. DEPENDENCY MANAGEMENT

### 22.1 Rules

- All dependencies must be in `package.json` — no global installs in production
- `pnpm-lock.yaml` is committed and must not be manually edited
- No dependency added without verifying: license compatibility, maintenance status, bundle size impact
- Security audit: `pnpm audit` run in CI — zero critical/high vulnerabilities allowed

### 22.2 Update policy

- Patch updates: applied without approval
- Minor updates: applied with testing
- Major updates: require addendum to this document if the package is listed in §3

